            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Tokyo",
            "review_text": "cmbobby\nCanggu, Indonesia23 contributions\n1\nAte here 2 nights in a row with the family\nSep 2019 • Family\nSushi Tokyo was a great find for our family and a nice break from Vietnamese food. Our kids love Japanese food so we were so happy to find this on our recent trip to Vung Tau. Quality of food was fairly good, not amazing. We had maki rolls, aburi, ramen, chicken katsu .. kids loved the buzzer service and privacy of the upstairs rooms. Excellent dinner in Vung Tau!\nRead more\nWritten September 9, 2019",
