            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Tokyo",
            "review_text": "ewtravelblog\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam151 contributions\n0\nArgurably the best Japanese Restaurant in Vung Tau\nAug 2018 • Family\nPatronized this restaurant several times for both lunch and dinner during our 4 days 3 nights stay in vung tau. The menu selection and food proportions are good. Looks like a very popular restaurant as it will be packed if you come late. Very reasonable price and price is without VAT (10% cost saving). Location is easy to find. Highly recommended. Go before 12 noon for lunch or 6 pm for dinner to get good seats.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 5, 2018",
