            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Tokyo",
            "review_text": "lynhdan\nLas Vegas, Nevada437 contributions\n1\nEh\nJun 2018 • Solo\nSushi Tokyo is small humble establishment in Vung Tau. The server car is friendly. The food comes out quick. However, the quality is average. I was looking forward to enjoy this place. As you can see from the photo, I ordered a variety of sushi for myself. I don’t mind paying a lot if it’s worth my wild. The presentation of the platting is very beautiful, but consistency of the rolls lacks. Sashimi cut was nice and thick, but the temperature and freshness was not there. Rolls were interesting and creative, but it was mushy and did not stay together well. \n\nWill I give this place another chance, yes I will.\nRead more\nWritten June 17, 2018",
